%% 02 · Read phase — Understand → Coach sales playbook → Plan
flowchart TD
  SRC["sources[] + selected duration1–5minutes (default3)<br/>[DATA · demo.json]<br/>Studio opens a blank draft; first change saves it; explicit demo links retain context"]:::data
  ISV{"kind?<br/>[FUNCTION · understand.run]"}:::dec
  UPV["gemini.upload_file<br/>[LIBRARY · Gemini Files API]<br/>in: mp4/mov · out: file uri (poll until ACTIVE, ≤600 s)"]:::data
  SHOTS["shot list<br/>[AGENT · Gemini 3.6 Flash]<br/>in: whole video + VIDEO_PROMPT<br/>out: ShotsOut · start/end s, part, feature, quality 1-5 (≤60 shots)"]:::agent
  STILLS["one still per good shot<br/>[LIBRARY · ffmpeg]<br/>only when the demo has video and no images · midpoint of shots with quality ≥ 3 · ≤12 · added as image sources (derived_from = shot)"]:::fn
  IMGS["image tags<br/>[AGENT · Gemini 3.6 Flash]<br/>in: batches of ≤12 images<br/>out: ImagesOut · description, angle, quality, full_product, parts — each {name, box_2d 0-1000 → {x,y,w,h} 0-1, confidence}"]:::agent
  PDFIM["Embedded PDF pictures within Understand<br/>[FUNCTION · sources.extract_pdf_images]<br/>≤96 pictures / 48MiB total / 100 pages; cooperative30s deadline<br/>normalized pixel hashes + parent revision; timeout results retry<br/>parent exclusion/deletion/revision follows pictures through publication"]:::fn
  IDS["assign ids<br/>[FUNCTION]<br/>sh01.., uploaded im01.., stable im_pdf hashes + source_id"]:::fn
  CRAWL["Scoped discovery and evidence capture<br/>[FUNCTION · crawl.py]<br/>exact model + market/locale; relevant sitemap/navigation pages and policies<br/>40 HTML / 10 documents / 300 pages / depth4; visible blocked/deferred frontier<br/>public IP pinned fetch; controlled headless rendered fallback"]:::fn
  DOCS["sources.source_text<br/>[LIBRARY · pdfplumber / pypdf / docx; OCR when needed]<br/>whole section/page/table headers + footnotes; ~20k-character reader batches<br/>same-page chunks stay together; oversized page stays whole; no silent clipping"]:::data
  FACTS["fact registry + brand + product<br/>[AGENT · configured text tier and build order]<br/>default eval: Gemini → Claude → Runware; customer: Runware → Gemini → Claude<br/>explicit BUILD_PROVIDERS wins; model IDs and runtime order unchanged<br/>Gemini shared text adapter: rules in actual system_instruction; source transcript in contents<br/>exact Gemini3.8 structured builds use LOW thinking; unchanged JSON budgets/fallbacks<br/>in: product / brand document batch (rivals excluded) + product hint + optional revision instruction<br/>out: FactsOut · numeric and categorical facts, pairings/fitment with source ref/locator/quote<br/>actual source product defines category; stale hint/schema examples do not<br/>retain stale-source warnings; partial-batch absence is not a whole-upload unknown<br/>source review still required; schema validity does not prove completeness"]:::agent
  COMP["competitor document facts<br/>[AGENT · same text fallback chain]<br/>official URL / PDF / doc / text → separate C-facts<br/>retain variant conditions, truth, source URL, locator, quote and read date"]:::agent
  FIDS["Merge batch metadata + immutable assertion IDs<br/>[FUNCTION · understand._product_from_batches / knowledge.reconcile]<br/>category correction needs strict majority of ≥2 agreeing normalized batches<br/>ties/pluralities keep primary; other product/brand/fact precedence unchanged<br/>uploaded document precedence only for genuine same-scope conflict; preserve both + review<br/>exact quote in retained text or single PDF cell on the cited page/source/revision<br/>no cross-cell concatenation or fuzzy evidence<br/>pinned snapshot + BM25/concept/character retrieval index"]:::fn
  UND["understanding.json<br/>[DATA]"]:::data
  CUSTOMER["Customer questions the sources could not answer<br/>[DATA · source=customer, asked_count, session_id]<br/>deduplicated runtime unknowns; never facts"]:::data
  LIB["Category sales order · version 2026-09-23<br/>[DATA · agents/playbooks.py]<br/>compact SUV / premium SUV / electric scooter / generic inferred order"]:::data
  CACHE{"registry hash, library version, audience, category, Coach prompt<br/>and consumed evidence/picture inputs unchanged; no instruction?<br/>[FUNCTION · coach.run]"}:::dec
  COACH["Sales playbook<br/>[AGENT · configured text tier · coach.py]<br/>in: category order + approved registry, image evidence, unknowns and revision instruction<br/>out: ordered stops, three USPs, objections and evidence gaps<br/>MOCK_LLM=1 uses deterministic keyword assignment"]:::agent
  CVAL["Validate playbook<br/>[FUNCTION · coach.validate / apply_overrides]<br/>approved fact / allowed picture ids only · duplicate stops keep first · first stop fundamental<br/>USP count/name errors stay issues: first three, strip unsafe tokens or drop<br/>Planner inherits only three valid USPs, else keeps its own · unsupported stops optional with gaps<br/>open customer unknowns become evidence gaps with counts; resolved gaps disappear"]:::fn
  PB["playbook.json + saved order/kind overrides<br/>[DATA · library version / key, registry hash, audience, issues]<br/>reviewed stops, three USPs and evidence gaps"]:::data
  PLAN["Evidence mapping, literal pictures and segment briefs<br/>[AGENT · configured text tier · plan.py]<br/>in: effective PLAYBOOK before approved registry, tagged media, brand, language + previous plan<br/>one proof segment per required stop; Coach's order and USPs are settled<br/>intro previews the first supported fundamental in everyday words<br/>goal = moment + spoken/deeper IDs and conditions + visual/handoff intent<br/>typed stop_id / fundamental / word_budget; no final dialogue"]:::agent
  PVAL["Enforce evidence and playbook coverage<br/>[FUNCTION · plan.run / _enforce_playbook]<br/>fact_ids ⊆ approved registry · visual_refs ⊆ allowed shots∪images<br/>map stop_id or fact overlap; drop unmapped/optional proof segments<br/>add missing required stops + issue; sort by role and stop order; inherit USPs/version"]:::fn
  BUDGET["Allocate supported narration budget<br/>[FUNCTION · narration.word_target / plan._enforce_budget]<br/>target selected minutes ×60 ×2.5words/s ×1.10; default495words; matching recordings can raise it<br/>reserve23overview +45closing; guided stops share remaining words<br/>fact-backed story stops allow bounded short batches for selected length; missing evidence stays a gap<br/>every Author run prepares current Plan automatically; no extra planner/persona call"]:::fn
  PJ["plan.json<br/>[DATA · stop_id, fundamental, word_budget; total_words, playbook_version]"]:::data
  SAMPLE["voice sample<br/>[LIBRARY · Sarvam Bulbul v3 → Gemini TTS → Cloud/browser]<br/>in: voice.sample_line · out: audio/hash.wav"]:::data
  DRAFT["Author → Deck<br/>[AGENT + FUNCTION · see diagram 04]<br/>grounded script, visual audit and editable slides"]:::fn
  FAQ["Uploaded questions only<br/>[AGENT + FUNCTION · faq.doc_questions / faq.run]<br/>answer uploaded FAQ documents; no guessed-question generation or quota<br/>keep customer entries and rejected tombstones; migrate legacy banks once"]:::fn
  EMPTY{"No active entries or open customer unknowns?<br/>[FUNCTION · approve_empty_faq]"}:::dec
  AUTO["Approve Asked and answered automatically<br/>[FUNCTION · orchestrator / graph.align_enter]<br/>No questions yet; this card fills from customer questions"]:::fn
  OPEN["opening message<br/>[AGENT · Claude text tier · text]<br/>in: card summary · out: 3-5 sentences (template fallback on error)"]:::agent
  CONV["conversation.json<br/>[DATA] + SSE 'message'"]:::data

  SRC --> ISV
  ISV -- "video" --> UPV --> SHOTS --> IDS
  SHOTS -- "no images uploaded" --> STILLS --> IMGS
  ISV -- "image" --> IMGS --> IDS
  ISV -- "enabled product / brand PDF pictures" --> PDFIM --> IMGS
  ISV -- "product / brand pdf / doc / url / text" --> CRAWL --> DOCS --> FACTS --> FIDS
  ISV -- "role=competitor: URL / PDF / doc / text" --> COMP --> UND
  IDS --> UND
  FIDS --> UND
  CUSTOMER -. "questions only" .-> UND
  UND --> CACHE
  LIB --> CACHE
  CACHE -- "yes: reuse unchanged" --> PB
  CACHE -- "no" --> COACH --> CVAL --> PB
  PB -->|"revalidate overrides, then inline PLAYBOOK"| PLAN
  UND --> PLAN
  PLAN --> PVAL --> BUDGET --> PJ --> SAMPLE --> DRAFT --> FAQ --> EMPTY
  EMPTY -- "yes" --> AUTO --> OPEN
  EMPTY -- "no: human review" --> OPEN
  OPEN --> CONV

  classDef agent fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#2563eb,color:#0b2a5b;
  classDef fn fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a,color:#052e16;
  classDef dec fill:#f3e8ff,stroke:#9333ea,color:#2a0a4a;
  classDef term fill:#e5e7eb,stroke:#6b7280,color:#111827;
  classDef ask fill:#cffafe,stroke:#0891b2,color:#083344;
  classDef data fill:#ede9fe,stroke:#7c3aed,color:#2a0a4a;
